      "cooked": "<p>News: Sentinels of the Multiverse is a 2-5 player game, in which 3-5 Heroes team up against a Villain in a dynamic Environment!</p>\n<p>Funny stuff. Looks like the moderators want to step in to the conversation, yet decided not to.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
