      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-10T06:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I noticed it aswell. Pretty funny that they decided to post it up to insure that everyone is well aware that the <span class=\"bbcode-b\">rules</span> state there should be at least three heroes but no more than five. Hopefully that will prevent any more arguing amongst all the fellow SotM players. After all if the heroes using the power non-stop bickering than Baron Blade will have time to pull the moon to the Earth.</p>\n<p>I think I thought of a new hero power:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Bickering Among Friends</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Power: All heroes skip their turn until the start of your next turn.</p>\n</blockquote>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:26.754Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
