      "cooked": "<p>Awww… Just a environment, but I like pretending that Megalopolis had sunken to the bottom of the ocean to the Ruins of Atlantis, which would of initiated a floatation device that would lift the two onto Insula Primalis which would cause volcano to erupt shooting all three into the Wagner Mars Base.</p>\n<p>I would call it Mega-Atlantis Primalis Mars Base.</p>",
