      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/ecae2f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-10T11:13:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Strange, considering one of the Story Challenges is a two-player victory over a villain…<br>\nI’ll admit that’s not quite a regular occurrence, though, and some villains would certainly be harder than others (give or take scaling with H).</p>\n<p>Still, the creators (in interviews and so forth) seem to take the attitude that it’s okay to play games your own way… just don’t blame them if the game isn’t balanced for it. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:26.984Z",
