      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-10T13:26:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well story stroy challenge was for the core game, which didn’t have the H mechanic in it. Not too mention it was really hard to defeat anyone with two heroes which made it a challenge. Now with the introduction of the H mechanic it actually makes the game extremely easy with two heroes, considering the great deal of H-2 for damage towards Heroes making it due 0 damage.</p>",
