      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-10T14:26:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, since that story challenge was written for the base game and before the (H) was introduced, then it follows that if a player wants to try that story challenge against the Rook City villains, they should set H=4 and proceed with 2 heroes. I believe that this is the intended interpretation.</p>",
