      "created_at": "2012-07-10T23:34:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was thinking somehow also being able to mix the Villain Character cards themselves.  Not sure how to make it work well though.  Maybe two Villains decks with Villain Characters at 3/4 HP would likely be a fair balance between the fact there are now two Villains and the fact that many heroes have multiple target damage.  Not sure how to keep heroes from being pummelled by two Villains going off, though.</p>",
